  "Sharpe uses daily returns x sqrt(365). Bootstrap = circular 10-day blocks, 10,000 draws, seed 20261012.",
  "desk column of baseline_daily.csv ends each day at 22:00 UTC; others at 00:00 UTC. 'sensitivity_aligned_00utc' uses the desk re-run (identical trades) with a 00:00 UTC day boundary.",
  "C1 has no data before 2020-09 (BTC) / 2021-12 (ETH, SOL): flat then. VT/TS/C1 inverse-vol weights use IS days from each series' first active day.",
  "Desk per-coin series come from the 2020-start $150 run; 'planned_separate_accounts' restarts their equity at $150 at each window start without re-running the desk (the $10 minimum interacts with equity, a second-order effect)."
 ]
